sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Memory tab chat
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant C as Memory chat agent
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant LLM as Model (LLM_PROVIDER)

    UI->>API: POST /api/memory/chat {message}
    API->>C: chat(message)
    C->>Mem: base rules (code) + current learned rules
    C->>LLM: rewrite the learned rules per the message (structured: rules, reply)
    LLM-->>C: learned_preferences, reply
    C->>Mem: update_preferences(learned_preferences)
    C-->>API: reply, learned rules
    API-->>UI: reply shown in the chat, learned rules refreshed
    Note over Mem: The next email's recall step sees the new rule.
